[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9483.349, "timestamp": "02:38:03", "text": "了解しました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9486.87, "timestamp": "02:38:06", "text": "何てことだ。いいえ。彼が私を殴ったんです。彼は私を殴った。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9489.429, "timestamp": "02:38:09", "text": "よし、食べるために牛を捕まえに行かなきゃ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9504.63, "timestamp": "02:38:24", "text": "待って、なぜ？ああ、これってあなたの物ですか？私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9507.83, "timestamp": "02:38:27", "text": "推測。どれ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9511.03, "timestamp": "02:38:31", "text": "私は金の道具を身につけている。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9514.229, "timestamp": "02:38:34", "text": "ええ、とりあえずはそれらを使ってください。わかった。わかった。おお、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9516.07, "timestamp": "02:38:36", "text": "蘇生機能を使うことができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9519.11, "timestamp": "02:38:39", "text": "そうしたい。はい、すぐにやります。させて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9523.59, "timestamp": "02:38:43", "text": "まずはさっと何か食べ物を買ってきます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9526.51, "timestamp": "02:38:46", "text": "ああ、なんて素晴らしい剣なんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9529.269, "timestamp": "02:38:49", "text": "ええ、つまり、私はただいくつか手に入れようとしているだけです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9531.349, "timestamp": "02:38:51", "text": "木材。私は持っていたと思います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9534.15, "timestamp": "02:38:54", "text": "十分。いや、絶対に違う。私は自分が"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9537.063, "timestamp": "02:38:57", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Today's Guest - Totembtw | https://www.youtube.com/@Totembtw | https://x.com/Totembtw_ | https://www.instagram.com/Totembtw "}]